A bit rusty? Ok here we go… Listen up because I’m only gonna remind you once! #speaker: Flair #portrait: flair #layout: right
To move left and right, use the <b><color=\#000000>A</color></b> and <b><color=\#000000>D</color></b> keys. To jump, use the <b><color=\#000000>W</color></b> Key.
On your way you’ll see some coins. Pick them up to earn money, you’ll be able to start using them soon.
Once you start getting closer to your bounty Huxley, his minions are going to start attacking you. 
To defeat them, use the mouse to aim and click to shoot your gun. Oh! And to reload the gun, use the <b><color=\#000000>Spacebar</color></b>. 
Watch out! If you get hit by an enemy you lose health!
Got it. #speaker: Ace #portrait: ace #layout: left
Good luck Ace! #speaker: Flair #portrait: flair #layout: right #movement: unlocked